  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the licorice regional wall fight, after Fang Yuan in ancient sword dragon form rips off Hei Lou Lan’s left arm, the traces on his dragon claw turn into blood colored fire that climbs onto his scales. She names the immortal killer move Flesh Blood Fire. His ancient sword dragon body is a perfect target, so he drops the transformation, returns to human form, and activates Man as Before.",
